WEBVTT

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:33.340
<i>"Water Station #22 - 1 km"</i>

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.500
<i>Noriko. Let's stop at the next village...</i>

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.710
<i>I'm fine</i>

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:01.120
<i>I'm sorry I'm such a burden...</i>

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.460
<i>Dad!</i>

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.030
<i>Are you alright, Dad?!</i>

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:19.120
<i>I'm truly sorry... - I... - I!</i>

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:22.760
<i>You know you're not supposed to say it</i>

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.690
<i>Noriko!</i>

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.330
<i>Dad!</i>

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.820
<i>Noriko!</i>

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.810
<i>Dad?</i>

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:37.140
<i>Noriko!</i>

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.710
<i>Dad?!</i>

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:44.010
<i>Dad!</i>

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.910
<i>Centuries after the collapse
of modern civilization...</i>

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.080
<i>The Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.820
<i>In this world of survival of the fittest...</i>

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:00.190
<i>...- the victor is right -</i>

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:07.570
<i>And the victor of this fight
is known and feared as a ghost</i>

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:11.020
<i>The Handyman of the Desert
- His name...</i>

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.480
<i>"Sunabouzu - Desert Punk"</i>

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:18.870
And...

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.020
... this...

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.750
... is the end!

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:35.570
I shot yet another trifling thing

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.840
I'm so hilarious!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:42.730
<i>Don't tell me you're!</i>

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.450
It's a piece of cake when
there's no chicks involved...

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:58.710
But those were some mighty good boobs!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.600
No!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.530
I must never work with broads!
I must ignore them!

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.810
Especially ones with giant breasts!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.390
From now on, it's only
innocent and lovely...

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:19.110
<i>- Hands up, jerk!
- But slowly!</i>

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.710
<i>You scared or somethin'?!</i>

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.380
<i>Just make with the hands!</i>

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.440
<i>"Repo Man - Amagumo"</i>

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.820
<i>He can't even talk, Bro!</i>

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:35.560
<i>You're all show! Now hand over yer money!</i>

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.830
They're goners...

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:41.470
He's like the greatest repo man there is!

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.190
They say when his hands move,

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:46.430
he collects not just money,
but souls too!

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.090
<i>So you want me to take my hands out?</i>

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.770
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:56.410
<i>Just do what we say and we won't kill ya...</i>

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:09.240
<i>- Ouch!
- What the hell is this?!</i>

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.830
<i>Thread? Damn you!</i>

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:20.060
<i>I took my hands out. What should I do next?</i>

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.590
<i>- Ow, ow!
- Ow, ow!</i>

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:35.570
<i>Kill us!</i>

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:39.300
<i>We can't go back to town
like this, you brute!</i>

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.370
<i>Yeah! We'd never hear the end of it!</i>

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.820
<i>We'd rather die!</i>

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.350
<i>Is that so?</i>

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.380
<i>- Just kidding!
- We'll buy some undies!</i>

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:53.060
<i>- They're no fun...
- How uncool...</i>

00:05:54.910 --> 00:06:00.300
So, collecting souls means
tearing people's pride to shreds?

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.310
<i>I consider it reimbursement.</i>

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:07.520
<i>So it was the famous Sunabouzu
who was spying on me, huh?</i>

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:11.030
Oh, you noticed? Pretty slick, Amagumo!

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:13.130
We've never met before, though...

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:18.530
<i>The Sunabouzu is the talk of
the Kanto region somewhat...</i>

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.400
I got a look at how you work

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:28.580
and at how skilled the #1 repo man
in the tiny Kanto area really is!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:32.310
<i>How I'd love to see the
clever techniques of the guy</i>

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.550
<i>who bullies people
to make a name for himself.</i>

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:38.670
Who knows, you just might be
able to experience 'em firsthand!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:44.890
Hey!

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:48.370
<i>One of these days.
I have pressing business to attend to.</i>

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.570
That's too bad!

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.780
Ran into a creep first
thing in the morning...

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.440
Today's not my lucky day.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:07.040
<i>My, that was fast.</i>

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.040
So what's my next job?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.010
<i>"Handyman Guild - Mugenya"</i>

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.240
<i>Just a minute...</i>

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:21.050
<i>Mommy, I'm hungry!</i>

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:24.180
<i>Here we are, Water Station #22.</i>

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:28.200
<i>A Koike Kazuo-san lives there,</i>

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:34.740
<i>and Akashio Financial wants someone
to collect on his unpaid loan.</i>

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.050
Let's see... - 29-3...

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:42.850
29-3... - Is this it?

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.810
Talk about ghetto...

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:51.440
Hello! Is Koike Kazuo-san home?

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:55.840
Oh?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.010
<i>Koike-san is an acquaintance of yours?</i>

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.300
I have no acquaintance this
incredibly stupid or poor.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:14.010
But if a repo man like you
is here, does that mean...

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.220
<i>I'm obviously here to collect on a debt!</i>

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:21.660
<i>Koike-san borrowed money from
Oshio Financial in the South Oasis</i>

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.950
<i>and today's the repayment due date...</i>

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:28.970
<i>Unfortunately, I'm told he
doesn't have a single cent...</i>

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:32.390
Damn, this isn't looking good...

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:36.220
<i>Incidentally, what's a handyman doing here?</i>

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.170
Hold on, you old fart!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:42.410
You swindled money
from two places at once?!

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.980
Give back the money
you borrowed from Akashio!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:49.210
<i>"I.O.U."</i>

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.670
Give back the money

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.240
<i>What?!</i>

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:51.410
He owes Akashio today, too!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:57.540
You got some guts making
both repayment days the same!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.900
Hand it over! Hand it over right now!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.640
<i>Hey! Hold on! I was here first!</i>

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.420
So what?! First one to get repaid wins!

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.140
<i>- What?!
- Damn you!</i>

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.930
<i>Just give up and go home!</i>

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:10.720
You know I can't do that!

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:13.020
Why're you ransacking the house?!

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:16.080
<i>It's finders-keepers!</i>

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.020
<i>There's not a damn thing there!</i>

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.030
And the place reeks like mad!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:38.740
<i>I'm sorry! In my condition,
I can't even work enough to...</i>

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.840
<i>Koike-san,</i>

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:46.970
<i>Do you know how people can
make a living lending money</i>

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.730
<i>in this lawless region?</i>

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.850
<i>No...</i>

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:54.140
<i>Because no matter the obstacles,
no matter how much they resist,</i>

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:58.880
<i>we hunt down creditors
and capture them alive.</i>

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:02.930
<i>Yes, it's because there are
professional repo men like us around</i>

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:11.730
<i>And we use any means necessary
to always get the money repaid</i>

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:15.380
I'm known far and wide for
always carrying out my jobs!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.730
And I don't show mercy
to sick, old geezers!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.160
<i>Dad!</i>

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:26.770
A babe! A little dusty, though...

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:29.650
<i>What are you doing to my father?!</i>

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:38.680
<i>I see. So you were working in
place of your sick father...</i>

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:42.860
<i>I'm sorry, I knew today was the due date...</i>

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:47.800
<i>But wasn't that clearly too much
money for a woman to work off?</i>

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:51.860
<i>Yes! I worked myself to the bone, but...</i>

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.280
<i>Just when I found a job
at a printing plant,</i>

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.820
<i>it's owner was murdered by bandits...</i>

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.380
<i>Get lost!</i>

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.480
<i>... and I never got paid...</i>

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:09.010
<i>And my job of hauling things...</i>

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:14.140
<i>As a girl, I couldn't keep at it long!</i>

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:17.680
<i>And the side job I finally found...</i>

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.000
<i>I'm just so clumsy!</i>

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:33.940
<i>Forgive me, Noriko. I'm so worthless...</i>

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.750
<i>Are you alright, Dad?!</i>

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:41.720
<i>It's not your fault; that
stupid illness is to blame!</i>

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:45.810
<i>No, I've burdened everyone...
Even your mother...</i>

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:51.480
<i>Oh, Dad... You know you're
not supposed to say it</i>

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.720
<i>Noriko!</i>

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:00.580
<i>Don't worry! Let's work hard together!</i>

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:06.960
<i>Oh, dear! Not in front of company, Dad...</i>

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:09.200
Um...

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:13.220
I could maybe convince Akashio...

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.270
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.210
... to wait 10 days or so...

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.270
<i>Really?!</i>

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.300
M-maybe...

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.370
What?!

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:31.090
<i>Nothing...</i>

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:32.080
Liar!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:36.230
I know you're thinking, "What a
softy," or, "He fell for her charm!"

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:42.080
But what else is there? Tearing
this place up won't get us anything!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.210
<i>I wouldn't be so sure.</i>

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:46.220
<i>No!</i>

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:48.040
<i>There's always her!</i>

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.860
<i>Noriko!</i>

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:52.570
What the hell're you
doing with Noriko-san?!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.720
Are you all right, Dad?!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:57.450
<i>Eh?</i>

00:12:57.450 --> 00:13:00.200
<i>Even if she is poor and covered in dirt,</i>

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:04.250
<i>she has beauty worthy of
a gentle and pure heart!</i>

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.470
<i>I bet I could get a lot for her!</i>

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.710
Oh, good thinking!

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:14.150
Wait, no! Don't you have
any blood or tears?!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:16.850
<i>Nope</i>

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:22.280
<i>So how do you plan to get money
out of this penniless family?</i>

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:25.250
<i>As you said, there's not a thing here.</i>

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.900
<i>This girl is the only thing worth money.</i>

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:32.400
<i>How do you plan to collect on
their debt without selling her?</i>

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:37.380
<i>Aren't you known far and wide for
always carrying out your jobs?</i>

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.750
I got it!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.540
We'll sell Noriko-san!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.630
But!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.150
I'm the one buyin' her!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:56.370
Therefore, I'll only pay off
their loan with Akashio

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.950
You and the old fart can do
something about the southern one!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.570
<i>What an idiot- Looks like
talking this out...</i>

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.170
<i>... is a waste of time!</i>

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.530
The winner gets Noriko-san!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:15.900
The loser thinks up another way
to collect on their debt! Agreed?!

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.660
<i>Assuming the loser survives.</i>

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.220
Another thing,

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:23.310
I won't let Noriko-san become
a victim of your unsavory hobbies!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:26.920
<i>I'd appreciate you not badmouthing
other people's hobbies.</i>

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.540
<i>What's goin' on?!</i>

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.200
<i>This don't look so good!</i>

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:35.020
<i>It's a duel! Supposedly between
the Amagumo and Sunabouzu!</i>

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.200
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.390
<i>I sure hope that ain't true!</i>

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:43.770
<i>Seems they're fighting
over Koike-san's girl!</i>

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.420
<i>A ghost and a god of death...</i>

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.350
<i>- Elder?!
- Why are you here?!</i>

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.610
<i>They must not be allowed to fight!</i>

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:55.930
<i>The village will be blown away if they do!</i>

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:05.960
<i>He appears out of nowhere</i>

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:11.160
<i>and leaves unbeknownst to anyone</i>

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.800
<i>He flies in the sky, burrows in the earth</i>

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.230
<i>confuses and insults people</i>

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:24.310
<i>to accomplish all his jobs</i>

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:29.010
<i>The Ghost of the Desert - Sunabouzu!</i>

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:36.010
<i>Sunabouzu! Sunabouzu!</i>

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:43.130
<i>Elder! Who's...</i>

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.630
<i>Say no more</i>

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:58.010
<i>In spite of the dust storms,
he doesn't let his prey escape</i>

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:01.110
<i>He catches fleeing debtors</i>

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:07.320
<i>Every last one a soulless, pitiable</i>

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:13.990
<i>and disabled piece of garbage</i>

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.260
<i>He's a true god of death</i>

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:23.390
<i>A repo man!</i>

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.620
You seem to be quite popular

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.590
As do you

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.990
His skills are the real deal.

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:43.040
But he basically relies on gadgets like me.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:46.720
Tricks meant for idiots
won't work on him!

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:52.140
<i>His mind is addled, but he
must be famous for a reason.</i>

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:55.620
<i>Plus, he's seen my tricks...</i>

00:16:56.600 --> 00:17:01.550
This could turn into one helluva fight!

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.960
<i>What is this?</i>

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.380
<i>It's just an ordinary shootout...</i>

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:01.080
<i>I tried too hard to anticipate
how he'd attack!</i>

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.850
<i>To think this would be such a
degrading war of attrition... - !</i>

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.730
Dammit! What a waste of ammo!

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:14.230
<i>Honey! You know you shouldn't wander about!</i>

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:18.410
<i>Yoko-san- When is today's lunch?</i>

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:22.330
<i>You just ate! Now come on home!</i>

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.820
<i>Where the hell did you get that gun?!</i>

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:30.220
Where were you hiding yours?!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.750
<i>Eat this!</i>

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.220
Oh, crap!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.330
Payback!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:42.980
<i>Out of ammo and resorting to pistols...
This is getting too lame!</i>

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.730
<i>Die, punk!</i>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.100
I'm gonna tear you a new one!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:59.230
Damn you! Give up already!

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.780
<i>I've had just about enough of you!</i>

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.980
Noriko-san is mine!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:06.890
<i>Die, you lowlife perv!</i>

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.820
Ow! Damn you! I ain't gonna fall
victim to your perversions, either!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:12.410
<i>It's almost suppertime.</i>

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:15.150
<i>- Let's go.
- How lame...</i>

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:36.410
Amagumo-san... - Your punches
ain't so strong now...

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:40.500
<i>Ha! You can't even stand up straight!</i>

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:58.470
<i>- Finally found ya, Amagumo!
- Time to pay for this morning!</i>

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.410
<i>Finally found ya, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:02.360
<i>Time to pay for this morning!</i>

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.880
<i>Time to pay!</i>

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:14.300
<i>Ouch!</i>

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.500
<i>What happened, Bro?</i>

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:47.040
Amagumo...
You're pretty good!

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.440
<i>You too, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:57.710
A short break and then we'll continue!

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:09.420
<i>Two I.O.U.-s, all ours!</i>

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:16.760
<i>You always make the due date
on the day of Mom's death... - !</i>

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:21.600
<i>But we sure were lucky this time</i>

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:26.590
<i>One of them was a lowlife perv,
so they trounced each other!</i>

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:31.280
<i>Your mother was watching out for us!</i>

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:37.060
<i>Don't be getting tomato juice
on my clothes again!</i>

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:42.550
<i>Now that we've burned the
I.O.U.-s and gotten out of debt,</i>

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:45.550
<i>where should we borrow money from next?</i>

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:49.540
<i>Oh, dear- Just be sure to buy
me some new clothes!</i>

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:54.070
<i>You know, living really is tough...</i>

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:56.560
<i>Very tough.</i>

00:21:58.890 --> 00:22:00.670
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:06.240
<i>In this world of survival of the
fittest, the victor is right.</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:11.110
<i>The loser is a moron, garbage, and wrong.</i>

00:22:11.110 --> 00:22:16.350
<i>Men, women, old people, idiots, and
scum all live here at full blast.</i>

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:19.090
<i>Sunabouzu's Earnings for Today:
- 1,693,452 yen</i>

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:20.760
<i>Breakdown:
Repayment of Koike Kazuo's Loan</i>

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:23.420
<i>Job Expenses and Ammunition
Equipment Repair</i>

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:56.500
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:56.500 --> 00:23:59.060
<i>The boob lady next episode is...
Eh? There isn't one?!</i>

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:01.730
<i>- And what if there isn't?!
- No! I need my boobies!</i>

00:24:01.730 --> 00:24:03.600
<i>The Sunabouzu, devastated</i>

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:05.770
<i>On the next Sunabouzu,
Tank and Machine Guns</i>

00:24:05.770 --> 00:24:08.240
<i>Miss it and I won't pay up!</i>
